---
import arc from "../data/arc.json";
---

<section id="arc" class="border-t border-line/60 py-20">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">四个季度 · 一条诚实的工程线</p>
    <h2 class="reveal mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">从可信 RAG，到把负结果修成正结果</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted">
      每一季都是一个独立 tag 的真实结果。负结果不藏——它们带根因（失败分类法 F1–F13）和落地的修复，
      这才是这个项目最强的真实性证据。
    </p>

    <ol class="mt-12 space-y-4">
      {
        arc.map((c) => (
          <li class="reveal card p-6 sm:p-7">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
              <div class="sm:w-40 shrink-0">
                <div class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-brand">{c.q}</div>
                <div class="num mt-1 text-xs text-faint">{c.tag}</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">{c.title}</h3>
                <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {c.metrics.map((m) => (
                    <span class="pill border-line bg-surface-2 text-ink">
                      <span class="text-muted">{m[0]}</span>
                      <span class="num text-brand">{m[1]}</span>
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </div>
                <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
                  <span class="font-semibold text-pending">诚实 ·</span> {c.negative}
                </p>
                <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                  {c.codes.map((code) => (
                    <span class="num rounded border border-line px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-faint">{code}</span>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
